  ['MAINT_TEETH 24 both rings · two pawls π apart = 12 pitches, so they act in unison']: 'MAINT_TEETH 兩環皆 24 · 兩爪相隔 π = 12 距 — 故齊發',
  ['THE LIVE TORQUE PATH']: '活的扭矩路徑',
  ['crown → winding spur']: '錶冠 → 上鏈小齒',
  ['fusee cone → base ratchet flange']: '寶塔輪錐 → 基座棘輪法蘭',
