  ['the rim\'s mid-plane and stand 0.3 proud of this']: '位於輪環中面，凸出此緣 0.3，',
  ['edge, all the way round.']: '一整圈都是。',
  ['THEY STAND PROUD OF NO FACE']: '它們不凸出任何平面',
  ['Screw half-thickness 0.6 against the rim\'s']: '螺絲半厚 0.6 對輪環',
  ['half-height 0.6875: the screws sit inside the']: '半高 0.6875:螺絲坐在輪環',
  ['rim\'s z-band, top and bottom.']: 'z 帶之內，上與下。',
