  ['flank = 0.18 pitch — CUT, not narrated (TODO 20: the mesh and the law are one function)']: '側面 = 0.18 柱距 — 切出來的，不是說出來的（TODO 20:嚙合與定律是同一個函數）',
  ['lock beak · OFF']: '鎖喙 · 關',
